        "text_Ej6ykD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2><strong>Place a test order...</strong></h2><p></p><h2>If you are familiar with placing test orders on Shopify, you can enter \"1\" for the credit card number and any date in the future for exp - use \"123\" for the cvv.&nbsp;</h2><p>The custom analytics Web Pixel is a secure, high-performance tracking extension that operates entirely within Shopify's sandboxed Web Worker, replacing legacy, DOM-reliant frontend scripts. Configured via the Shopify Admin to accept custom API endpoint URLs, it natively subscribes to the checkout_completed event stream and executes background TypeScript logic to parse the checkout schema. It extracts critical order data—such as the checkout total, currency, and order ID—while iterating through cart lines to dynamically evaluate a custom has_subscription boolean flag.&nbsp;</p>"
          }
